{"id":"perf_fc027957705ae656","title":"华夏音乐节·泱泱国风 纪念——陈燮阳与苏州交响乐团音乐会","city":"苏州","venue":"苏州文化艺术中心","hall":"金鸡湖音乐厅","startTime":"2027-07-10T11:30:00.000Z","weekday":"周六","dateLabel":"07/10","timeLabel":"19:30","description":"“泱泱国风”作为苏州交响乐团持续打造的中国作品品牌系列，始终以交响艺术赓续中华文脉，礼赞民族精神，展现中国音乐的时代风采。本场音乐会，指挥陈燮阳将携圆号新锐曾韵，以《八一交响诗》的恢宏气象、《纪念》圆号协奏曲的人文情怀，以及《长征交响曲》的磅礴史诗，共同勾勒中华民族薪火相传的精神图景。从历史回望时代，于音乐凝聚力量，彰显中国交响音乐植根民族文化、回应时代命题的艺术生命力。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238949065","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-music-sea50n/2088146908616671232.html","scrapedAt":"2026-08-16T17:20:43.253Z","ensemble":"苏州交响乐团","conductor":"陈燮阳","performers":["陈燮阳","曾韵"],"composers":["刘福安、卞祖善、马友道、程寿昌","施咏康","丁善德"],"program":[{"composer":"刘福安、卞祖善、马友道、程寿昌","title":"八一交响诗","confidence":"official","id":"program_a587a0009d44f156","workId":"work_e79a6b70fd03b417"},{"composer":"施咏康","title":"纪念圆号协奏曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_9b961a73218f7476","workId":"work_9a39a897fa5136dd"},{"composer":"丁善德","title":"长征交响曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_785498adb527ed43","workId":"work_eb25676377043998"}],"tags":["刘福安、卞祖善、马友道、程寿昌","施咏康","丁善德","交响","音乐会"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_f48a67cc7c84e774","priceTiers":[],"sources":[{"sourceId":"suzhou-symphony-official","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"szsorch_2088146908616671232_1815219000000","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-music-sea50n/2088146908616671232.html","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238949065","scrapedAt":"2026-08-16T17:20:43.253Z"}]}